 <h3><u>Ali ka darwaza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p dir=ltr>Bhala azim hay kitna, Ali ka darvaza (2)<br> Fazilato ne bhi dhoundha, Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>1. Khare the log bohot intezar mé lekin (2)<br> Sitara dekh ke utra Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>2. Nabi ke shehr me tum kis tarha se jaoge (2)<br> Ke raaste me padega Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>3. Qassam hai khanae Kaba tere tabassum ki (2)<br> Khuda ke ghar me bhi dekha Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>4. Halakato se bachane ke vaste khud ko (2)<br> Falan falan ne bhi dhoundha Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>5. Mukhalefin bhi ye soch kar yahan pohche (2)<br> Kabhi na band milega Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>6. Rasool jab shabe meraj arsh par pohche (2)<br> Faraze arsh pe dekha Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p dir=ltr>7. Jo dushmanane Ali hay, kahan vo jaenge (2)<br> Dare jina pe hay likkha Ali ka darvaza</p> 
  <p>8. Bilal Buzaro Salman sabhi khade the vahan (2)<br> Jo mayne ghor se dekha Ali ka darvaza</p> 
